Round 4 note: Coral Cay, its lighthouse, the hovercraft, the darts bar, the job
board and the dive buoys are original creations for this game, made for this round.
The ferry, the storm weather and the night market stalls are original too.

Round 5 note: the garage, casino, taxi depot, gym, flight school, safehouse,
stock market, stunt ramps, postcards, seasons, heat zones, responder shifts,
rival racers and the two new radio stations are original creations for this
game, made for this round. Ryan and Ian, Marisol, Solmar Bay, Coral Cay and
every place name in the game are original; no real city, person or franchise
is depicted.
